A bibliography and an index, compiled by the engine host with no TeX Live
(scripts/notex-host-check.sh, notex-gate.yml): with external tools allowed the
host runs its own bibtex and makeindex (lane RUST-TOOLS), and their outputs
must equal expected/, which TeX Live 2026's bibtex and makeindex made from the
same files as latexmk runs them (`pdflatex main`, `bibtex main`,
`makeindex -o main.ind main.idx`).

The style, plain.bst, comes from the bundle: TeX Live's `bibtex` package, which
holds the standard styles plain, alpha, abbrv and unsrt, is in the bundle since
texbundle-tl2026-2 (tools/bundle/tl2026/extra.txt). Bundles before it lacked it,
and the check then shipped its own copy.
